rminal شكله بقى إيه والـ Retries شغالة إزاي، وشاركني النتيجة!","thinking":"**Confirming Action & Adjustments**\n\nOkay, I'm ready to respond! I've acknowledged the rate limits and Arabic inversion issues. The errors were due to hitting the 503 and 429 quota limits for Gemini 3.8 Flash. To address this, I've switched over to the `gemini-2.5-flash` model. I'm feeling confident in the new selection.\n\n\n"}
